rectangle "nyx\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4>> {
  rectangle "nyx-physics\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4LXBoeXNpY3M=>> {
    rectangle "==Physics trait and registry\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe Physics trait (everything the rest of nyx may ask of a physics), the Registry of the physics a build contains, and the plain-data error every method returns." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxphysics.Physicstraitandregistry
    rectangle "==Problem envelope\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe one shape every physics is given (ProblemSpec), its decoding into typed parameters with descriptor defaults and name resolution, and its structural validation." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxphysics.Problemenvelope
    rectangle "==Descriptors and schemas\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nWhat a physics tells nyx about itself (studies, conditions, parameters) and the JSON Schemas generated from it for the window, the MCP server and the documentation." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxphysics.Descriptorsandschemas
    rectangle "==Result and frame\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nSolveResult as plain serialisable data, and the frame a result states for the analysis of its vector fields." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxphysics.Resultandframe
    rectangle "==cQED result payloads\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nTyped superconducting quantum-circuit payloads (capacitance and inductance matrices, TLS geometry metadata, passive CircuitRom, driven port parameters)." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxphysics.cQEDresultpayloads
    rectangle "==Test support\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe golden-file harness and the contract-test helpers shared by every physics crate." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.nyxphysics.Testsupport
  }

  component "==femcore\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe FEM core: meshes, meshing and adaptation, linear algebra behind one driver, finite-element basics, the material specification and library, expressions." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.femcore
}

